WEBVTT

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.810
Run at once towards a dream

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.810
yume no mukou e ikkini hashitte yo

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:38.780
Let’s meet and laugh away yesterday’s troubles

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:38.780
nayameru kinou wo fungiri warai aou

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:44.860
When our memories were here,

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:44.860
omoide ga itta no toki mo

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:47.060
even though we are deeply hurt, go straight on

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:47.060
kizu wo fukai no ni massugu mae ni

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.650
GO TO NEW WORLD

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:54.470
I can feel it in the wind

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:54.470
kaze no naka kanjiteru yo

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:58.130
The hot beat is shining

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:58.130
atsui kodou kagayaku yo

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:00.610
especially now…

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:00.610
ima koso

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:07.550
surely, always, you’ll be by my side

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:07.550
kitto zutto soba ni iru yo ne

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:12.410
Keep on running the way to the future.

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:12.410
mirai no michi wo hashiri tsuzukeyou

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:17.300
more and more, no matter what happens

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:17.300
motto motto nani ga okitemo

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:21.510
half our tears become double smiles

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:21.510
namida wa hanbun nibai no egao ni naru

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.060
forever

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.060
itsudemo

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:48.590
SARA!!!

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:03.880
Shirogane-san!

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:05.470
Detective…

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:21.660
The Wadatsumi Facility and Project Ikaros are sinking into the lake, huh?

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:25.750
Even if they die, they’ll protect
the secret of their merchandise.

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:27.580
It’s kind of beautiful, isn’t it?

00:02:28.150 --> 00:02:31.080
But, the self-destruction device…

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:32.300
There’s a large heat response!

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:33.850
Is it an explosion?

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:34.840
It’s coming up on the monitor!

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:43.930
Startup!

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:46.350
That’s not an explosion…

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:47.520
That’s not an explosion at all!

00:02:48.090 --> 00:02:49.980
Something has started to move!

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:52.030
It’s not self-destructing?

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:54.500
What on earth…

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:57.780
I don’t know.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.470
Wait for me, Sara-chan, Rentarou!

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:35.820
It’s show time!

00:04:40.850 --> 00:04:41.750
Rentarou!

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:45.020
Why?!

00:04:47.650 --> 00:04:48.750
Finally…

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:50.250
Finally…

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:57.340
Even… even though I had already given up on our time together.

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:05.300
Wh-What is that?

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:08.050
All units in position.

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:09.500
Begin firing at once.

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:26.300
It’s useless!

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:57.210
Forget it.

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:00.220
Forget it, Rentarou!

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:05.340
You have Soujyu, don’t you?

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:09.180
So… just forget about me…

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:17.270
Shut up.

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:23.360
Wouldn’t it be fine if I didn’t exist?

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:26.610
If I didn’t exist,

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:30.330
you’d have Soujyu, wouldn’t you?

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:35.160
That’s why… be together with Soujyu!

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:37.500
Treasure her!

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:40.700
I’ll be fine with that…

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:49.110
SHUT UP!

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:54.850
“If I didn’t exist,” huh?

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:56.680
“Treasure Soujyu,” HUH?

00:06:57.300 --> 00:07:00.060
Don’t say that sort of crap, dammit!

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:02.950
Hear me? Listen carefully!

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:09.250
Really… I’m saying what I really feel from the bottom of my heart, all right?

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:10.850
I’ve got no money,

00:07:10.850 --> 00:07:13.400
I’ve got no plans or vision for the future either.

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:19.210
But hey, I’ll be with you and Soujyu!

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:22.150
Can you hear me? We’re not alone!

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:23.210
We’re not just two…

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:24.590
…but THREE people!

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:31.440
I WANT US TO BE THREE!

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:03.800
Rentarou!

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:05.000
Yeah!

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:06.710
The three of us!

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:07.880
Yeah!

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:12.200
Rentarou!

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:14.000
Sara-chan!

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:14.720
Soujyu!

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:30.450
Sara! Soujyu!

00:08:31.050 --> 00:08:31.450
Yes!

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:34.400
Let’s clean up and go home!

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:35.240
The three of us!

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:36.450
Right!

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:39.450
LET’S GO!

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:56.140
Whatever you do, it’s useless!

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:02.400
Take this!

00:09:22.050 --> 00:09:27.500
DETECTIVE KICK!

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:51.070
Lately, I’ve been having a recurring dream.

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:54.850
It is a totally random dream,

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:57.100
about arranged marriages,

00:09:57.100 --> 00:09:58.700
secret societies,

00:09:58.700 --> 00:09:59.800
squid monsters

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:00.890
and biplanes.

00:10:01.650 --> 00:10:04.900
It’d be tiresome to explain
it all logically but…

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:07.500
Well… even though it’s like that,

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.380
if I were to try and
sum it up in one phrase…

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:16.800
Well?

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:18.450
Are you awake?

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:19.850
I am.

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:21.690
Indeed I am.

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:25.000
But hey!

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:25.440
You trying to kill me?!

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:27.250
Sorry!

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:39.740
That’s why I told you to leave it to me!

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:43.750
But, then I would have ended up with nothing to do!

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:48.040
It’d still be better if you did nothing and just sat down there!

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:49.750
How mean!

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:53.590
Meanie, meanie, meanie, meanie, meanie, meanie, meanie, meanie!

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:53.590
But it’s because…

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:07.650
It’s already been three weeks since that.

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:18.980
The Germany incident and Nikotama’s incident.

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:23.780
I don’t know why, the only one that took it seriously was Nikosports.

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:31.890
Within the world, I wonder if there are many sides and systems that are unknown to us.

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:48.380
It’s over, Ainosuke.

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:04.050
To begin with, WHY aren’t we allowed to board foreign airplanes normally?

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:06.000
You’re noisy.

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:07.700
Well,

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:10.850
she just can’t suppress her urges, I guess.

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:12.550
Or something like that.

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:14.850
AH, geez!

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:19.430
How the hell do you say
“call an attorney” in German?!

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:24.050
Come out.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:25.560
Huh?

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:34.900
I can do nothing but comply…

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:37.570
But, who on earth are you?

00:12:40.950 --> 00:12:43.840
It’s probably safer for you…

00:12:43.850 --> 00:12:46.570
…if you don’t worry too much about that.

00:12:48.650 --> 00:12:51.650
By the will of someone in a country somewhere,

00:12:51.650 --> 00:12:53.800
the world continues to spin.

00:12:55.150 --> 00:12:58.700
Only God can hope to understand all of this.

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:04.750
That’s all that’s scheduled for this afternoon.

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:05.980
Starting at 1 pm,

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:08.700
we will have the final confrontation
with the inaugural opposition group.

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:12.110
We have already finished
handing out the benefits…

00:13:12.110 --> 00:13:14.300
to the ones attending
behind the scenes,

00:13:14.300 --> 00:13:18.920
more than half of the people at the hall will be on our side.

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:29.620
President.

00:13:32.800 --> 00:13:33.920
Catch…

00:13:37.450 --> 00:13:38.580
…wanna play?

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:48.630
That would be good.

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:55.750
But… even still…

00:13:55.750 --> 00:14:00.490
In the end, the parts that we did understand are stretched out in front of our eyes;

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:04.050
the things that we call our lives.

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:08.120
With all our strength, we can do nothing but idiotically and energetically live it out.

00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:11.050
I could do nothing else but that.

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:19.960
It’s probably fine that way.

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:09.470
You also became an attractive man like your father!

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:13.580
They always kept saying that.

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:06.120
Isn’t your hair a bit weird?

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:08.800
Waah, don’t touch it like that!

00:17:12.450 --> 00:17:13.400
Sorry!

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:15.180
We made you wait.

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:21.680
Well, shall we go?

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:44.350
Yo!

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:47.850
Oh, Futaba-san, Shirogane-san!

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:49.090
Yo!

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:58.970
Err…well then, it’s about the time.

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:02.450
Now for the entrance of the bride and the groom!

00:18:02.450 --> 00:18:03.100
HERE!

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:25.600
Oba-chan, you’re beautiful!

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:27.600
Gen-san’s cool too!

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:29.250
The world’s best!

00:18:29.950 --> 00:18:33.950
Well… Aren’t they a splendid couple?

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:38.850
Well then! It’s time for the congratulatory speech!

00:18:38.850 --> 00:18:43.350
The representative of the friends, Futaba Rentarou-san!

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:44.270
Please!

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:46.650
Wha? Huh?? Ehh?

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:53.200
Yo, Nidaime!

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:55.190
Futaba-san! Do your best!

00:18:55.850 --> 00:18:58.150
Ah… They won’t listen…

00:18:58.800 --> 00:19:00.610
Come on, just go and do it!

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:19.800
Well…

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:22.650
Um…

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:25.650
Rentarou!

00:19:25.650 --> 00:19:26.850
Fight!

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:34.810
ARE YOU HAPPY?!

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:41.800
WE’RE HAPPY!!!

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:19.350
Lately, I’ve been having a recurring dream.

00:20:20.600 --> 00:20:22.200
It is a totally random dream,

00:20:23.050 --> 00:20:25.250
about arranged marriages,

00:20:25.250 --> 00:20:26.900
secret societies,

00:20:26.900 --> 00:20:28.200
squid monsters

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:29.300
and biplanes.

00:20:29.850 --> 00:20:32.970
It’d be tiresome to
explain it all logically but…

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:38.960
Well… even though it’s like that, if I were to try and sum it up in one phrase…

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:43.100
It is probably…

00:21:51.300 --> 00:21:57.760
It is probably a story about love.

00:22:20.050 --> 00:22:25.730
We are here.

00:22:20.050 --> 00:22:26.000
bokura wa koko ni iru

00:22:26.100 --> 00:22:33.170
We will be here.

00:22:26.100 --> 00:22:33.170
bokura ga koko ni aru

00:22:33.550 --> 00:22:38.490
The slow time is

00:22:33.550 --> 00:22:39.540
yuruyaka na jikan ga

00:22:38.730 --> 00:22:45.420
flowing in this room.

00:22:39.540 --> 00:22:45.420
nagareteru kono heya de

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:49.020
The spring days glitter

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:49.830
haru no hi ga kira kira

00:22:49.220 --> 00:22:53.080
together with the smiles

00:22:49.830 --> 00:22:53.980
egaototomoni

00:22:53.200 --> 00:22:59.900
as an unending chain of happiness.

00:22:53.980 --> 00:23:00.840
kagirinai shiawase no rensa

00:23:00.230 --> 00:23:05.800
Believe strongly

00:23:00.840 --> 00:23:05.800
aa negatta hibi wo

00:23:06.110 --> 00:23:14.080
that you have obtained that awaited day.

00:23:06.110 --> 00:23:14.560
te ni shitta sono omoi chikara nishite

00:23:14.340 --> 00:23:19.520
Hey, the days are wonderful.

00:23:14.560 --> 00:23:19.520
nee subarashii hibi

00:23:19.820 --> 00:23:27.190
Lovingly embrace your feelings.

00:23:19.820 --> 00:23:27.870
itoshiku omou kimochi wo daite

00:23:27.320 --> 00:23:33.760
I won’t say goodbye, because forever

00:23:27.870 --> 00:23:34.680
sayonara wa iwanai yo datte itsumademo

00:23:34.000 --> 00:23:39.040
the days will be unchanged.

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:39.040
kawaru koto no nai hibi

00:23:39.230 --> 00:23:45.950
Surely forever. M

00:23:39.230 --> 00:23:45.950
kitto itsumademo
